   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%\">Phil:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%\">I have\r\nestimated a unidimensional and a bifactor model on a dataset.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%\">1. When I change\r\nthe estimation method to ML the reliabilities of the specific factors become a\r\nlot larger than the default estimation method. However, for the unidimensional\r\nmodel the reliability of the default estimation method is a lot greater than the\r\nML estimation method.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%\">2. I have also\r\nestimated a 2-dimensional model. The correlation between the two dimensions is slightly\r\ngreater than 1 and the reliability\r\ncode returns an error.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%\">Can you\r\nplease comment?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%\">Best</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%\">Afshin</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%\"> </span></p><div><br></div><span class=\"gmail_signature_prefix\">-- </span><br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div><div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
