   "date": "2023-05-31T13:59:10Z",
   "subject": "Re: Reliability with different estimation methods",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">1. This is expected, changing estimators will change the reliability estimates. In general I&#39;d recommend using Bayes estimators over ML for this type of application.<div>2. If your correlation is greater than 1 then the model likely did not successfully converge and therefore should not be used further. <br><div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Phil</div></div></div></div><br></div></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
